Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.17,0:00:02.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Your argument is lacking in all scientific merit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.17,0:00:02.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的论点完全没有科学价值
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.92,0:00:04.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And it is well-established...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.92,0:00:04.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且大家也公认…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.71,0:00:08.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...Superman cleans his uniform by flying into Earth's yellow sun...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.71,0:00:08.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}超人是靠飞进地球的黄太阳 清洁他的衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.22,0:00:10.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...which incinerates any contaminant matter...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.22,0:00:10.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太阳可以烧掉任何污染物质
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.47,0:00:14.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and leaves the invulnerable Kryptonian fabric unharmed and daisy fresh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.47,0:00:14.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只留下坚不可摧的氪星纤维 完整无缺 超级干净
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.10,0:00:18.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What if he gets something Kryptonian on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.10,0:00:18.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要是他沾到氪星的东西怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.27,0:00:22.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Like what? -I don't know. Kryptonian mustard.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.27,0:00:22.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-像什么？ -不知道 氪星芥末
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.36,0:00:25.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think we can assume all Kryptonian condiments were destroyed...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.36,0:00:25.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们可以假设所有氪星调味料…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.61,0:00:28.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...when the planet Krypton exploded.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.61,0:00:28.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在氪星爆炸时就被摧毁了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.36,0:00:30.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Or it turned into mustard Kryptonite.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.36,0:00:30.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不然就是变成芥末氪星
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.49,0:00:34.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The only way to destroy a rogue Kryptonian hot dog threatening Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.49,0:00:34.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是解除劣质氪星热狗 对地球威胁的唯一办法
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.58,0:00:38.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Raj, please, let's stay serious here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.58,0:00:38.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拉吉 拜托 严肃点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.33,0:00:41.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Superman's body is Kryptonian, therefore his sweat is Kryptonian.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.33,0:00:41.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}超人是氪星人 因此他的汗也是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.04,0:00:44.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, what about Kryptonian pit stains?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.04,0:00:44.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 那氪星腋下汗渍呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.00,0:00:46.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Superman doesn't sweat on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.00,0:00:49.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-超人在地球不会流汗 -好 他被邀请到瓶中城坎多吃晚餐
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.96,0:00:49.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. He's invited for dinner in the bottle city of Kandor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.84,0:00:53.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He miniaturizes himself, enters the city, where he loses his super-powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.84,0:00:53.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他把自己缩小进入城市后 就会失去超能力
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.43,0:00:56.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Before dinner, his host says, "Who's up for Kryptonian tetherball?"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.43,0:00:56.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在晚餐前 主人问“谁想玩氪星绳球？”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.68,0:00:59.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Superman works up a sweat, comes back to Earth, his uniform now stained...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.68,0:00:59.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}超人玩了 流了汗 再回到地球 制服上就有汗渍
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.06,0:01:02.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...with indestructible Kryptonian perspiration.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.06,0:01:02.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这也是坚不可摧的氪星汗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.73,0:01:07.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Booyah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.40,0:01:12.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Superman would have taken his uniform to a Kandorian dry-cleaner...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.40,0:01:12.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}超人离开瓶子前
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.66,0:01:14.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...before he left the bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.66,0:01:14.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}会把制服拿去坎多干洗店
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.45,0:01:19.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Kandorian dry-cl--? I give up. You can't have a rational argument with this man.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.45,0:01:19.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}坎多干洗？我放弃 你不能和这家伙讲道理
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.33,0:01:24.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, isn't that the guy who won the MacArthur genius grant last year?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.33,0:01:24.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那不是去年得了 麦克阿瑟天才奖学金那个人？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.38,0:01:27.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, not all at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.38,0:01:27.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 不要一起看
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.67,0:01:30.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Then how? -Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.67,0:01:30.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-那怎么看？ -莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.18,0:01:34.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now Raj.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.18,0:01:34.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}换拉吉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.51,0:01:37.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.51,0:01:37.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}换谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.10,0:01:41.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I didn't get a good look. Can I go again? -No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.10,0:01:41.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我没看清楚 可以再看一次吗？ -不行
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.10,0:01:45.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-That's David Underhill. So what? -So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.10,0:01:45.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-那是大卫安德希尔 又怎样？ -又怎样？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.27,0:01:48.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}His observation of high-energy positrons has provided the first evidence...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.27,0:01:48.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他对高能阳电子的观测 第一次证实了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.98,0:01:51.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...for the existence of galactic dark matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.98,0:01:51.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}宇宙黑暗物质的存在
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.19,0:01:54.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have two words for you. The first is "big," the other's "whoop."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.19,0:01:54.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}送你两个字 第一个字是“大” 另一个是“叫”
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.12,0:01:59.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It is a big whoop. Made almost all the work you've done completely useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.12,0:01:59.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}的确该大叫 那几乎让你的研究 都失去了价值
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.20,0:02:01.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Did not. -Did too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.20,0:02:01.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-才不是 -的确是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.25,0:02:03.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, maybe some of it. But....
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.25,0:02:03.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 或许有一点 可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.79,0:02:06.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The guy was just in the right place at the right time...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.79,0:02:06.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那家伙只是天时地利
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.29,0:02:09.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...with the right paradigm-shifting reinterpretation of the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.29,0:02:11.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还找到适当的典范转移诠释宇宙 他只是走运
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.17,0:02:11.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He got lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.46,0:02:12.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In more ways than one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.46,0:02:12.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不只是那样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.26,0:02:16.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's a very handsome man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.26,0:02:16.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-他还很帅 -帅也没有用
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.14,0:02:18.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Doesn't do anything for me. If I was gonna go that way...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.14,0:02:21.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要是我也出名 我会变成扎克埃夫隆那一类型的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.64,0:02:21.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I'm more of a Zac Efron kind of guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.56,0:02:26.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yeah. Like you have a shot with Zac Efron.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.56,0:02:26.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 说得好像你 有机会追到扎克埃夫隆似的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.52,0:02:30.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me. Are you Leonard Hofstadter?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.52,0:02:30.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}打扰一下 你是莱纳德霍夫斯塔特吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.32,0:02:32.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Uh, yeah. -I'm David Underhill.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.32,0:02:32.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-是的 -我是大卫安德希尔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.82,0:02:35.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh, yeah. Heh, heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.82,0:02:35.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.16,0:02:39.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dr. Gablehauser said if I wanted to set up something in the lab...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.16,0:02:39.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}盖博豪瑟博士说 要是我想准备实验室的器材
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.53,0:02:41.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...that you'd be able to give me a hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.53,0:02:41.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你能帮我的忙？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.62,0:02:44.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You wanna work with me? -If you have time, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.62,0:02:44.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你想找我合作 -要是你有空 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.25,0:02:48.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wow. Yeah, sure. Yeah, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.25,0:02:48.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 当然 没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.71,0:02:53.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Um, here's my home number, here's my cell, here's my office...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.71,0:02:53.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是我家电话 我的手机电话 办公室电话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.17,0:02:56.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...here's my parents' number up in New Jersey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.17,0:02:56.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我新泽西爸妈家的电话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.34,0:02:57.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-They know how to reach me. DAVID: Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.34,0:02:57.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-他们知道怎么找我 -好的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.05,0:03:01.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Congratulations on the MacArthur grant, by the way. Big fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.05,0:03:01.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对了 恭喜你得到麦克阿瑟奖 我是你的粉丝
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.22,0:03:03.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thanks. I'll call you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.22,0:03:03.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢 我再打给你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.35,0:03:04.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.35,0:03:06.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.98,0:03:06.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.06,0:03:14.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are you looking at? You've never seen a hypocrite before?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.06,0:03:14.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们在看什么？没见过伪君子吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.05,0:03:40.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Trailing badly, Wolowitz needs a strike...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.05,0:03:40.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}局势不利 霍华德沃洛维茨需要全倒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.43,0:03:42.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...if he has hopes of catching up with Sheldon...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.43,0:03:42.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}才能追上谢尔顿的分数
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.89,0:03:48.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...who is dominating in the ninth frame with a career-best 68.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.89,0:03:48.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}后者在第九格打出生涯最高分 68分
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.11,0:03:57.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}LEONARD: Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.11,0:03:57.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}各位
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.03,0:04:00.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That doesn't count. Do-over, do-over.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.03,0:04:00.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那不算 重来 重来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.95,0:04:03.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There are no do-overs in Wii bowling.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.95,0:04:03.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有重来的 这是保龄球游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.45,0:04:08.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There are always do-overs when my people play sports.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.45,0:04:08.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们运动的时候都能重来的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.08,0:04:11.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Where were you that's more important than Wii bowling night?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.08,0:04:11.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有什么事比打保龄球游戏重要？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.71,0:04:13.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Actually, I-- -It's a rhetorical question.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.71,0:04:13.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-事实上… -这是反问句
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.71,0:04:16.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There is nothing more important than Wii bowling night.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.71,0:04:16.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}保龄球游戏夜是最重要的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.55,0:04:19.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, it's just a video game and we suck at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.55,0:04:20.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托 只是电子游戏而已 而且我们技术很烂
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.63,0:04:20.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SHELDON GASPS]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.84,0:04:23.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nice motivational speech from the team captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.84,0:04:23.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}队长的发言真是激励人心
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.97,0:04:27.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Where were you? -I was working with Dave Underhill.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.97,0:04:27.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你去哪里了？ -我和大卫安德希尔一起工作
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.73,0:04:31.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ooh, "Dave." Sounds like Leonard's got a new BFF.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.73,0:04:31.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}“大卫” 听来莱纳德多了个新死党
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.65,0:04:36.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Actually, he is pretty cool. I mean, not only is he a brilliant scientist...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.65,0:04:36.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}事实上 他挺酷的 他不只是聪明的科学家
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.36,0:04:38.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but it turns out he's a black-diamond skier...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.36,0:04:38.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他还是技术高超的滑雪家
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.99,0:04:42.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...he collects vintage motorcycles, he plays in a rock band.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.99,0:04:42.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他收集古董摩托车 也玩摇滚乐团
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.53,0:04:45.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-So? We're in a rock band. -No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.53,0:04:45.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-那又怎样？我们也有摇滚乐团 -没有
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.45,0:04:49.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We play "Rock Band" on our Xbox.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.45,0:04:49.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们只玩电子游戏乐团
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.96,0:04:53.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nice motivational speech from our lead guitarist.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.96,0:04:53.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们第一吉他手的发言 真是激励人心
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.67,0:04:54.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's funny too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.67,0:04:54.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他也很风趣
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.88,0:04:59.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He does this hysterical impersonation of Stephen Hawking having phone sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.88,0:04:59.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他还模仿史蒂芬霍金的电话性爱
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.42,0:05:02.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[AS STEPHEN HAWKING] What are you wearing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.42,0:05:02.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你穿什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.26,0:05:06.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[IN NORMAL VOICE] That's not-- He does it better.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.26,0:05:06.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是这样 他做得比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.60,0:05:11.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He said he was gonna take me to the gym so I'm gonna go practice my sit-ups.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.60,0:05:11.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他说明天他要带我去健身房 所以我要去练仰卧起坐了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.10,0:05:15.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wow. Humongous man crush, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.10,0:05:15.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}基情四射啊 老兄
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.44,0:05:17.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yup, it's officially a bromance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.44,0:05:18.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 正式进入“基动”阶段
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.65,0:05:18.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[KNOCKING ON DOOR]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.65,0:05:22.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Sheldon. Are you and Leonard putting up a Christmas tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.65,0:05:22.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 你和莱纳德 弄好圣诞树了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.28,0:05:26.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, because we don't celebrate the ancient pagan festival of Saturnalia.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.28,0:05:26.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有 因为我们不庆祝 古代异教徒的农神节
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.79,0:05:28.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Saturnalia?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.79,0:05:28.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}农神节？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.12,0:05:34.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Gather around, kids. It's time for Sheldon's beloved Christmas special.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.12,0:05:34.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}过来吧 孩子们 谢尔顿最爱的 圣诞特别节目要开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.79,0:05:39.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In the pre-Christian era, as the winter solstice approached and the plants died...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.79,0:05:39.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在基督教以前的时代 冬至来临时植物死去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.76,0:05:43.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...pagans brought evergreen boughs in their homes as an act of sympathetic magic...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.76,0:05:43.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}异教徒将万年青树枝带回家里 作为一种交感巫术
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.80,0:05:47.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...intended to guard the life essences of the plants until spring.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.80,0:05:47.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}欲守卫植物生命本质 直到春天来临
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.18,0:05:49.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This custom was appropriated by northern Europeans...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.18,0:05:49.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个习俗被北欧人沿用
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.81,0:05:52.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and, eventually, it becomes the so-called Christmas tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.81,0:05:52.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}最后变成所谓的圣诞树
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.52,0:05:58.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And that, Charlie Brown, is what boredom is all about.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.52,0:05:58.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}查理布朗最无聊的程度 也不过如此
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.40,0:06:04.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, well, thank you for that. I got you and Leonard silly neighbor gifts...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.40,0:06:04.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 谢谢你的讲解 但我帮你和莱纳德 买了愚蠢的小礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.20,0:06:07.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-...so I'll just put them under my tree. -Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.20,0:06:07.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-那我放在我的树下好了 -等等
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.20,0:06:09.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You bought me a present? -Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.20,0:06:09.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你买礼物给我？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.54,0:06:11.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why would you do such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.54,0:06:11.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你为什么这么做？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.46,0:06:15.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I don't know. Because it's Christmas? -Oh, Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.46,0:06:15.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-不知道 因为是圣诞节？ -不 佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.17,0:06:16.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know you think you're being generous...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.17,0:06:19.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道你认为你很大方 但礼物的基础原则是互惠
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.92,0:06:19.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but the foundation of gift-giving is reciprocity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.67,0:06:23.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You haven't given me a gift, you've given me an obligation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.67,0:06:23.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不是给我礼物 是给了我一个义务
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.09,0:06:27.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't feel bad, Penny. It's a classic rookie mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.09,0:06:27.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别难过 佩妮 新手都会犯这种错误
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.01,0:06:31.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My first Hanukkah with Sheldon, he yelled at me for eight nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.01,0:06:31.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我第一次和谢尔顿过光明节 他吼了我八夜
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.60,0:06:35.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's okay. You don't have to get me anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.60,0:06:35.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没关系 你不用回送
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.85,0:06:39.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Of course I do. The essence of the custom is that I now have to go and purchase...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.85,0:06:39.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我当然要 这习俗的本质 就是我得去买…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.02,0:06:43.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...a gift of commensurate value and representing the same level of friendship...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.02,0:06:43.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一个等价的礼物 代表同等的友谊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.90,0:06:46.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...as that represented by the gift you've given me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.90,0:06:46.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}得和你送的礼物相当
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.07,0:06:50.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's no wonder suicide rates skyrocket this time of year.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.07,0:06:50.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}难怪每年这时候自杀率都会狂飙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.16,0:06:53.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, forget it, I'm not giving you a present.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.16,0:06:53.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 算了 我不送了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.41,0:06:56.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, it's too late. I see it. That elf sticker says "To Sheldon."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.41,0:06:56.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太迟了 我看到了 那个精灵贴纸上写着“给谢尔顿”
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.13,0:07:00.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The die has been cast. The moving finger has writ.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.13,0:07:00.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}骰子已经掷出 魔手已经伸出
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.54,0:07:02.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hannibal has crossed the Alps.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.54,0:07:02.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}食人族已经越过阿尔卑斯山
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.38,0:07:07.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know. It's funny when it's not happening to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.38,0:07:07.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道 发生在别人身上时 看起来真有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.60,0:07:14.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Sheldon, I am very, very sorry. -No, no. I brought this on myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.60,0:07:14.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢尔顿 我真的很抱歉 -不 我自找的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.22,0:07:17.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...by being such an endearing and important part of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.22,0:07:17.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁叫我在你的生活中 扮演这么可爱又重要的部分呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.02,0:07:21.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm going to need a ride to the mall.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.02,0:07:21.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我需要有人载我去购物中心
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.28,0:07:24.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's happening to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.28,0:07:24.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在发生在我们身上了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.07,0:07:29.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}LEONARD: Ow. Ow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.20,0:07:31.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}DAVID: Are you gonna make it? -Yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.20,0:07:31.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你可以吗？ -我想可以
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.58,0:07:36.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thanks for letting me try out your motorcycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.58,0:07:36.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢你让我试骑你的摩托车
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.21,0:07:40.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-No problem. -I had no idea it was so heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.21,0:07:40.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-不客气 -我不知道它那么重
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.67,0:07:44.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thing just fell right over on me, didn't it? Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.67,0:07:44.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}它就倒在我身上 是不是？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.34,0:07:47.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. Lucky for you it wasn't moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.34,0:07:47.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 还好它还没发动
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.93,0:07:50.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Oh, hey, Leonard. Ooh, are you okay? -Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.93,0:07:50.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-莱纳德 你还好吗？ -还好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.26,0:07:52.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's just a little motorcycle accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.26,0:07:52.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只是小小的摩托车意外
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.76,0:07:54.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God. How fast were you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.76,0:07:54.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的天 你骑多快？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.60,0:07:57.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know. It was all such a blur.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.60,0:07:57.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不知道 一切都很模糊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.56,0:07:58.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[CHUCKLES]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.69,0:08:00.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good one. He couldn't even get it started.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.69,0:08:00.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}说得好 他根本还没发动
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.61,0:08:05.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hi. Dave. -Hi. Penny. So it's your motorcycle?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.61,0:08:05.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你好 我叫大卫 -我是佩妮 是你的摩托车吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.44,0:08:08.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Uh-huh. -Oh. Is it okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.44,0:08:08.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}车还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.03,0:08:11.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Lucky for the bike it landed on my leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.03,0:08:11.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还好车子倒在我腿上
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.78,0:08:15.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Mind giving me a hand with Speed Racer? -Oh, yeah. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.78,0:08:15.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-可以帮我扶一下极速赛车手吗？ -好 没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.62,0:08:17.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, um, Dave, how do you know Leonard?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.62,0:08:17.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大卫 你怎么会认识莱纳德？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.12,0:08:21.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I'm a physicist. -Ha, ha. No, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.12,0:08:21.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我是物理学家 -不 才不是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.79,0:08:24.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}DAVID: Why is that so surprising?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.79,0:08:24.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么这么意外？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.67,0:08:29.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}PENNY: Well, it's just that the physicists I know are indoors-y and pale.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.67,0:08:29.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我认识的物理学家都很宅 而且很苍白
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.80,0:08:31.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}LEONARD: I'm not indoors-y.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.80,0:08:31.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不是宅男
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.05,0:08:36.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just wear the appropriate sun block because I don't take melanoma lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.05,0:08:36.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我有涂防晒油 以免得黑色素瘤
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.22,0:08:38.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So are you and Leonard working on an experiment together?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.22,0:08:38.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你和莱纳德一起做实验吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.02,0:08:41.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Yeah, we are. -We're examining the radiation levels...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.02,0:08:41.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-对 -我们用新的暗物质侦测器…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.73,0:08:44.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...of photomultiplier tubes for a new dark-matter detector.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.73,0:08:44.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}检验光电倍增管的辐射值
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.69,0:08:47.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sweetie, sweetie, Dave was talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.69,0:08:47.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}亲爱的 大卫还在说话
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.90,0:08:49.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, I love science.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.90,0:08:49.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道 我喜欢科学
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.86,0:08:52.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Since when? -Since always.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.86,0:08:52.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-什么时候？ -一向如此
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.53,0:08:57.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Call me a geek, but I am just nuts for the whole subatomic-particle thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.53,0:08:57.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}叫我怪胎也行 但我超爱次原子微粒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.33,0:08:59.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}DAVID: The last thing I would ever call you is a geek.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.33,0:08:59.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我绝不会叫你怪胎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.08,0:09:03.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, well, that's what I am. Queen of the nerds.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.08,0:09:03.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我就是这样 书呆子女王
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.88,0:09:06.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, if you'd like, I could show you the lab we're working in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.88,0:09:06.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要是你愿意 我可以带你去看 我们的实验室
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.92,0:09:09.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We've got some cool toys, you know. Lasers and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.92,0:09:09.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们有些很棒的玩具 激光那一类的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.59,0:09:12.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, I have always wanted to see a big science lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.59,0:09:12.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}知道吗？ 我一直想看看科学实验室
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.14,0:09:15.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Since when? -Since always.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.14,0:09:15.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-什么时候开始的？ -一向如此
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.85,0:09:17.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard, are you okay here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.85,0:09:17.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 你可以了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.52,0:09:19.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Yeah, I guess. -How about we go see it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.52,0:09:19.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我想可以 -我们现在去看如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.77,0:09:22.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Afterwards, we take the bike up the coast, we grab a bite to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.77,0:09:22.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}之后我们可以到海边骑骑自行车 再去买点东西吃？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.10,0:09:26.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Um, yeah. Yeah, that sounds great. Let me just get my jacket.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.10,0:09:26.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 听起来好极了 我去拿外套
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.19,0:09:30.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[DOOR CLOSES]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.53,0:09:32.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Boy, she'll do, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.53,0:09:32.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}老兄 她真棒
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.82,0:09:36.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, if you like that type.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.82,0:09:36.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 如果你喜欢那一型
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.41,0:09:38.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So you and her...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.41,0:09:38.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那你跟她…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.54,0:09:40.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-No, just neighbors. -Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.54,0:09:40.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-不 只是邻居 -真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.08,0:09:44.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know how you live next door to that without doing something about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.08,0:09:44.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真不知道隔壁住了她 你怎么还能无动于衷
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.00,0:09:47.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.00,0:09:47.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}事实上…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.05,0:09:50.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...science is my lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.05,0:09:50.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我热爱科学
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.30,0:09:54.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Okay. Let's go. -All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.30,0:09:54.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-好 我们走 -好的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.43,0:09:56.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-See you tomorrow, Leonard. -See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.43,0:09:56.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-明天见 莱纳德 -再见
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.76,0:09:59.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Bye, Penny. Have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.76,0:09:59.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再见 佩妮 玩得开心点
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.85,0:10:05.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}SHELDON: Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.85,0:10:05.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.61,0:10:15.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did you forget your key?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.61,0:10:15.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你忘了带钥匙？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.29,0:10:28.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I don't see anything in here a woman would want.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.29,0:10:28.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这里没有女生会喜欢的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.50,0:10:33.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're kidding. You've got lotions and bath oils and soaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.50,0:10:33.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}开玩笑 这里有乳液、沐浴乳 还有肥皂
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.01,0:10:37.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's the estrogen hat trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.01,0:10:37.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是雌激素戏法
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.35,0:10:44.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What it is is a cacophonous assault of eucalyptus, bayberry, cinnamon and vanilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.35,0:10:44.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是对桉树、月桂果、肉桂 和香草的侵犯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.52,0:10:47.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's as if my head were trapped in the pajamas of a sultan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.52,0:10:47.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就像我的头卡在苏丹王的睡衣里
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.61,0:10:52.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, if you don't like this stuff, let's just go next door and build her a bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.61,0:10:52.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 要是你不喜欢这些 我们就去下一家店买只熊给她
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.53,0:10:56.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I told you before, bears are terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.53,0:10:56.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我跟你说过了 熊很可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.70,0:11:00.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, bath stuff. It's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.70,0:11:00.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托 沐浴用品 这很完美
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.70,0:11:03.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You got a scented candle, a cleansing buff.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.70,0:11:03.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这里有香氛蜡烛、沐浴棉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.70,0:11:06.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Spearmint-and-green-tea-scented bath oil promotes relaxation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.70,0:11:06.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}薄荷和绿茶沐浴乳有助放松
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.42,0:11:07.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That presupposes Penny is tense.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.42,0:11:07.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是假设佩妮的压力很大
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.04,0:11:11.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She knows you. She's tense. We all are. Buy a basket.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.04,0:11:11.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她认识你 她压力很大 我们都是 买个礼物篮吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.25,0:11:14.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Excuse me, we're ready. -No, we're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.25,0:11:14.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-不好意思 我们选好了 -不 还没
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.26,0:11:17.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let's say for a moment that I accept the bath-item-gift hypothesis.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.26,0:11:17.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我暂时接受“沐浴用品礼盒”这个假设
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.01,0:11:22.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I now lay the following conundrum at your feet. Which size?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.01,0:11:22.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在我再出个问题给你 要多大号的？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.22,0:11:24.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This one. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.22,0:11:24.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这一个 我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.48,0:11:27.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You put no thought into that. -I'm sorry. Ah....
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.48,0:11:27.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你根本想都没想过 -对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.94,0:11:30.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This one. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.94,0:11:30.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这一个 我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.52,0:11:33.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have insufficient data to proceed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.52,0:11:33.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}继续分析的数据不够充分
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.44,0:11:35.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Excuse me, miss? -Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.44,0:11:35.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-小姐 打扰一下？ -什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.36,0:11:38.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If I were to give you this gift basket...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.36,0:11:38.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果我送你这个礼品篮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.53,0:11:40.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...based on that action alone and no other data...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.53,0:11:40.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}仅根据这个举动 没有其他数据
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.03,0:11:45.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...infer and describe the hypothetical relationship that exists between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.03,0:11:45.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请推断并描述我们之间的假设关系
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.37,0:11:48.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.37,0:11:48.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.75,0:11:51.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.75,0:11:51.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}给你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.58,0:11:55.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now are we friends? Colleagues? Lovers?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.58,0:11:55.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们是朋友？同事？爱人？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.38,0:11:58.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you my grandmother?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.38,0:11:58.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是我祖母吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.93,0:12:01.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't understand what you're talking about...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.93,0:12:01.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不明白你在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.14,0:12:04.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and you're making me a little uncomfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.14,0:12:04.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你让我有点不舒服了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.02,0:12:07.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See? Sounds just like you and Penny. We'll take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.02,0:12:07.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看吧？就像你和佩妮的关系 我们买了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.40,0:12:14.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Leonard. Come, join us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.40,0:12:14.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 过来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.86,0:12:18.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, hey, Dave. And Penny. What a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.86,0:12:18.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大卫 还有佩妮 真是意外
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.45,0:12:21.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Leonard. Dave was showing me around the university.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.45,0:12:21.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 大卫带我去参观校园
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.20,0:12:23.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, this place is unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.20,0:12:23.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这地方真是不可思议
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.32,0:12:26.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, I know. I've been offering to show you around for a year and a half.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.32,0:12:26.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 我知道 我邀你参观 已经邀了一年半了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.29,0:12:28.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You always said you had yoga.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.29,0:12:28.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你一直说要练瑜珈
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.50,0:12:32.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I never said that. -Maybe I heard you wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.50,0:12:32.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我没说过 -或许我听错了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.58,0:12:35.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A lot of words sound like "yoga."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.58,0:12:35.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}和瑜珈相像的词很多
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.84,0:12:39.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is an amazing woman, Leonard. She has a curious and agile mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.84,0:12:39.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 这女人很棒 她很有好奇心 也很机敏
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.68,0:12:42.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not to mention being curious and agile in other respects.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.68,0:12:42.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}更不用说其他方面也很好奇和机敏
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.97,0:12:44.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.97,0:12:44.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快住嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.76,0:12:47.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, please, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.76,0:12:47.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 拜托住嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.48,0:12:52.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, um, Dave, don't you think you and I should get back to the lab?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.48,0:12:52.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大卫 你不觉得我们该回实验室了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.35,0:12:55.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, that dark matter isn't gonna detect itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.35,0:12:55.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}暗物质不会自己测试自己
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.74,0:13:02.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was thinking about taking the afternoon off so I could experiment with Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.74,0:13:02.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我下午想请假 好和佩妮一起做实验
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.16,0:13:05.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Really? We're gonna do an experiment? DAVID: Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.16,0:13:05.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的？我们要做实验？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.66,0:13:10.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're gonna explore the effects of tequila shots on a gorgeous 22-year-old woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.66,0:13:10.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们要探索龙舌兰酒 在22岁美女身上会有什么影响
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.16,0:13:13.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's not an experiment. You saw what happened last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.16,0:13:13.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那不是实验 你昨天就知道结果了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.08,0:13:16.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}DAVID: You ready to go? -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.08,0:13:16.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-要走了吗？ -好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.54,0:13:18.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Oh, can I drive the motorcycle? -Yeah, why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.54,0:13:18.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我能骑摩托车吗？ -有何不可？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.09,0:13:20.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can't do any worse than Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.09,0:13:20.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的技术不会比莱纳德差
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.01,0:13:23.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Oh, my God. -No, that's good. That's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.01,0:13:23.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我的老天 -不 很好笑
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.35,0:13:29.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}By the way, my leg is killing me. Thanks for asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.35,0:13:29.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}顺便说句 我的腿痛死了 谢谢关心
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.21,0:13:56.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mm. Great news, Leonard. I've solved my Penny gift dilemma.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.21,0:13:56.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 好消息 我解决了佩妮礼物的难题了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.92,0:13:58.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yippee.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.80,0:14:02.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You see, the danger was that I might under- or over-reciprocate...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.80,0:14:02.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我回的礼可能太轻或太重
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.22,0:14:04.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but I have devised a foolproof plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.22,0:14:04.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我想出一个傻瓜计划
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.72,0:14:10.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I will open her gift to me first and then excuse myself, feigning digestive distress.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.72,0:14:10.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要先拆她的礼物 找借口离开 假装消化不良
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.18,0:14:13.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then I'll look up the price of her gift online...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.18,0:14:13.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后上网查她的礼物价格
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.39,0:14:17.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...choose the basket closest to that value, give it to her...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.39,0:14:17.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}选择最接近价格的篮子送她
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.19,0:14:20.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and then I'll return the others for a full refund.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.19,0:14:20.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后再把其他篮子全额退货
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.57,0:14:23.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.57,0:14:23.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}聪明
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.40,0:14:25.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It is, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.40,0:14:25.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是呢 对不对？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.95,0:14:27.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is it okay if I hide them in your room?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.95,0:14:27.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我能不能把东西藏在你房间？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.99,0:14:31.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The smell makes me nauseated.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.99,0:14:31.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这味道让我觉得恶心
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.58,0:14:34.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Do whatever you want. -Thank you. That's very gracious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.58,0:14:34.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-随便你 -谢谢 你真仁慈
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.83,0:14:38.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Gentlemen?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.83,0:14:38.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}先生们？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.84,0:14:44.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}HOWARD: Why couldn't you have just done what Leonard did...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.84,0:14:47.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你何不学学莱纳德帮佩妮找个新男友？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.51,0:14:47.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and get Penny a new boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.39,0:14:54.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My leg is killing me. Thanks for asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.39,0:14:54.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的腿痛死了 谢谢关心
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.57,0:15:03.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[KNOCKING ON DOOR]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.03,0:15:07.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, I have just one question for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.03,0:15:07.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 我只有一个问题要问你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.36,0:15:09.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}While I am perfectly happy with the way things are...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.36,0:15:09.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很满意目前的情况
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.95,0:15:13.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you said that you didn't wanna go out with me because I was too smart for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.95,0:15:13.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你说你不想和我交往 是因为我太聪明了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.87,0:15:18.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, news flash, lady: David Underhill is 10 times smarter than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.87,0:15:18.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}小姐 新闻快报 大卫安德希尔 比我聪明十倍
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.21,0:15:22.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You'd have to drive a railroad spike into his brain for me to beat him at checkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.21,0:15:22.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跟他下西洋棋 还得在他脑袋 钉根铁钉才能赢他
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.38,0:15:28.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Next to him, I'm one of those sign-language gorillas who knows how to ask for grapes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.38,0:15:28.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跟他比起来我只是会用手语 要葡萄吃的大猩猩
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.05,0:15:31.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So my question is...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.05,0:15:31.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的问题是…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.80,0:15:34.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...what's up with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.80,0:15:34.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是怎么一回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.85,0:15:37.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why are you yelling at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.85,0:15:37.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你为什么对我大叫？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.27,0:15:42.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sorry. I'm sorry, I'm sorry. Never mind, we're cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.27,0:15:42.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起…别在意 我没怪你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.73,0:15:45.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dave is not smarter than you. He's an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.73,0:15:45.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大卫没比你聪明 他是白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.49,0:15:48.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? Why would you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.49,0:15:48.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的？为什么这么说？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.99,0:15:52.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because a smart guy takes the nude photos of his wife off his cell phone...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.99,0:15:52.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为聪明人会先把手机里 太太的裸照删除
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.08,0:15:56.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...before he tries to take nude photos of his girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.08,0:15:56.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再帮新女友照裸照
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.29,0:15:59.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He tried to take nude photos of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.29,0:15:59.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他想照你的裸照？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.92,0:16:03.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's what you took from that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.92,0:16:03.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你只听到这一句？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.84,0:16:07.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The guy is married.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.84,0:16:07.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那家伙已婚
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.01,0:16:09.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.01,0:16:09.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.88,0:16:12.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sor-- Oh, that's terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.88,0:16:12.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很遗…太可怕了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.14,0:16:17.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And you. If you are so okay with the way things are between us, why are you jealous?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.14,0:16:17.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有你 要是你能接受我们 目前的关系 为什么要吃醋？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.52,0:16:18.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, that--
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.52,0:16:18.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.10,0:16:23.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The important thing is he's married and that's terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.10,0:16:23.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}重要的是 他结婚了 这真可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.90,0:16:28.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nice save, genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.90,0:16:28.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很会转移话题 天才
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.11,0:16:32.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Eggnog? -Lactose.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.11,0:16:32.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-蛋酒？ -有乳糖
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.20,0:16:37.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's just rum. It stopped being eggnog, like, a half an hour ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.20,0:16:37.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这只是朗姆酒 半小时前就不是蛋酒了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.04,0:16:43.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Smooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.04,0:16:43.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很顺滑
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.04,0:16:47.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Smoother than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.04,0:16:47.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}比你顺滑
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.22,0:16:51.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, it's Christmas. Just give me this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.22,0:16:51.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托 圣诞节了 就饶我一次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.51,0:16:54.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.51,0:16:54.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.56,0:16:56.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.56,0:16:56.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}圣诞快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.35,0:17:04.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}By the way, my leg is killing me. Thanks for asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.35,0:17:04.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}顺道一提 我的腿痛死了 谢谢关心
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.40,0:17:11.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[KNOCKING ON DOOR]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.86,0:17:14.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Merry Christmas. -Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.86,0:17:14.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-圣诞快乐 -圣诞快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.62,0:17:17.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-How's your leg? -Very good. Thanks for asking. Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.62,0:17:17.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你的腿还好吗？ -很好 谢谢关心 进来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.83,0:17:22.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, good, Penny, you're here to exchange gifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.83,0:17:22.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你好 佩妮 你来交换礼物了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.09,0:17:30.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You'll be pleased to know I'm prepared for whatever you have to offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.09,0:17:30.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你会很高兴知道 我的回礼准备得很周到
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.80,0:17:32.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.80,0:17:32.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 给你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.93,0:17:39.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I should note, I'm having some digestive distress...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.93,0:17:39.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我得说一句 我有点消化不良
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.52,0:17:45.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...so if I excuse myself abruptly, don't be alarmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.52,0:17:45.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以如果我突然离开 请别紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.16,0:17:56.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, a napkin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.16,0:17:56.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}噢 餐巾
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.24,0:17:59.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Turn it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.24,0:17:59.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}翻过去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.34,0:18:11.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"To Sheldon. Live long and prosper.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.34,0:18:11.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}给谢尔顿 祝你长寿昌盛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.71,0:18:14.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard Nimoy."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.71,0:18:14.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}伦纳德尼莫伊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.97,0:18:21.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, he came into the restaurant. Sorry the napkin's dirty. He wiped his mouth with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.97,0:18:21.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 他来过餐厅 不好意思 餐巾有点脏 他擦过嘴了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.19,0:18:30.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I possess the DNA of Leonard Nimoy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.19,0:18:30.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我拥有伦纳德尼莫伊的DNA？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.53,0:18:35.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well....
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.53,0:18:35.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.41,0:18:41.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, yeah, I guess. But look, he signed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.41,0:18:41.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 我想是的 但他签了名
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.37,0:18:44.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you realize what this means?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.37,0:18:44.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你明白这代表什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.21,0:18:51.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All I need is a healthy ovum and I can grow my own Leonard Nimoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.21,0:18:51.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只要有健康的卵子 就能培养出我自己的伦纳德尼莫伊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.55,0:18:59.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, all I'm giving you is the napkin, Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.55,0:18:59.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 我只给了你一条餐巾 谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.89,0:19:03.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.89,0:19:03.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}马上回来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.23,0:19:08.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Here, open it. -Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.23,0:19:08.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}给你 打开
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.73,0:19:12.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.23,0:19:15.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A gift certificate for motorcycle lessons.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.23,0:19:15.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}摩托车课程的礼券
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.74,0:19:20.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Very thoughtful. -Yeah, and I checked.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.74,0:19:20.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-真体贴 -对 而且我查过了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.16,0:19:24.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not letting the bike fall on you while standing still is lesson one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.16,0:19:24.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}第一课就是避免让静止的摩托车 倒到你身上
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.33,0:19:27.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, then I think you'll appreciate what I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.33,0:19:27.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那我想你会喜欢我送的礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.00,0:19:29.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.00,0:19:29.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.26,0:19:37.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"101 Totally Cool Science Experiments for Kids."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.26,0:19:37.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}给孩子的101个超酷科学实验
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.85,0:19:44.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, because you're so into science.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.85,0:19:44.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为你非常热爱科学
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.44,0:19:57.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, what did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.44,0:19:57.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 你在做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.53,0:20:00.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.53,0:20:00.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.28,0:20:02.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's not enough, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.28,0:20:02.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还不够 对不对？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.70,0:20:07.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here.
